* Averaged current-mode stand-in: 2 A/V into 10u || 1 ohm (pole 15.9 kHz), integrator EA.
* T = gm/(s Cc) * 2 * (1 || 1/(s C)) * 2.22/12.22, crossover about 22 kHz, PM about 35 deg
Vref ref 0 0.6
G1 0 comp ref fb 1m
Cc comp 0 1.46n
Ro comp 0 10meg
Gmod 0 out comp 0 2
C1 out 0 10u
Rload out 0 1
Rtop out fb 10k
Rbot fb 0 2.22k
.op
.end
